sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports security profile 3
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest (requestedMessage = SignChargingStationCertificate)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestedMessage must be SignChargingStationCertificate
    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: SignCertificateRequest (csr = <Configured CSR>, certificateType = ChargingStationCertificate)
    CSMS-->>CS: SignCertificateResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    CSMS->>CS: CertificateSignedRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: CertificateSignedResponse (status = Rejected)

    CS->>CSMS: SecurityEventNotificationRequest (type = InvalidChargingStationCertificate)
    CSMS-->>CS: SecurityEventNotificationResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
